# The workflows decide what reaches production: deploy.yml publishes :latest,
# Watchtower pulls it, and the container migrates the production database as
# it starts. A branch's pull request runs that branch's own copy of the file,
# so a change to it is a change to who can deploy (THO-987). This only asks
# for the owner's review once a branch rule on main requires code-owner
# review; that rule is a GitHub setting, not a file here.
/.github/workflows/ @Esemdis
# And this file, so the line above cannot be dropped without the same review.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Esemdis
